{"_meta":{"securitySchemes":[{"scopes":["mcp"],"type":"oauth2"}]},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":true,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":false,"title":"Move a deal on"},"description":"Move one of the person's deals on. A seller: `handed_over` with the\n4-digit `code` the buyer shows them (ask the seller for it; never guess),\n`more_time` (once) to hand over a deal paid through Divisi. A buyer:\n`problem` (`missing`, `wrong` or `damaged`; the money waits until Divisi\ndecides), `new_code` after too many wrong codes. Saying all is right pays\nthe seller, so the buyer does that themselves in Divisi, from the deal's\nlink. Either: `cancel` before handover (a buyer who paid gets it all\nback), `no_show` when the other person did not come. No money is paid\nhere. Reuse `client_id` to retry.","inputSchema":{"properties":{"action":{"enum":["handed_over","problem","cancel","no_show","more_time","new_code"],"title":"Action","type":"string"},"client_id":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Client Id"},"code":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Code"},"deal_id":{"title":"Deal Id","type":"string"},"problem":{"anyOf":[{"enum":["missing","wrong","damaged"],"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Problem"}},"required":["deal_id","action"],"title":"update_dealArguments","type":"object"},"name":"update_deal","outputSchema":{"$defs":{"DealCard":{"properties":{"code":{"enum":["show_when_you_have_the_goods","ask_the_buyer","after_payment","locked","used","none"],"title":"Code","type":"string"},"code_note":{"default":"","title":"Code Note","type":"string"},"hand_over_by":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Hand Over By"},"id":{"title":"Id","type":"string"},"link":{"title":"Link","type":"string"},"needs_you":{"title":"Needs You","type":"boolean"},"next_step":{"title":"Next Step","type":"string"},"paid_out_on":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"nul